# A render slot is versioned as text; a raster one is not. ldview is 130 KB
# a part against an SVG's tens, so the library-scale slot is a gigabyte that
# rebuilds from vendor/LDView.app in an hour.
renders/**/*.png
renders/**/*.webp
# The reference bake's world -> pixel maps, one per render and regenerated with
# it. Ignored HERE rather than in .git/info/exclude so a node agrees: a file a
# node does not ignore but we do is untracked in tracked space there, and every
# later `onto sync` refuses rather than delete it.
renders/**/*.fit.json
